[0.739147] (ldlidar) StdoutLine: {'line': b"4:   1. Set counterclockwise, example: {'laser_scan_dir': True}\n"}
[0.739165] (ldlidar) StdoutLine: {'line': b"4:   2. Set clockwise,        example: {'laser_scan_dir': False}\n"}
[0.739184] (ldlidar) StdoutLine: {'line': b'4: - Angle crop setting, Mask data within the set angle range:\n'}
[0.739202] (ldlidar) StdoutLine: {'line': b'4:   1. Enable angle crop fuction:\n'}
