[0.739239] (ldlidar) StdoutLine: {'line': b"4:     1.2. disable angle crop, example: {'enable_angle_crop_func': False}\n"}
[0.739258] (ldlidar) StdoutLine: {'line': b'4:   2. Angle cropping interval setting:\n'}
